      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. We're also looking at the potential for cross-contamination in the storage area. Since these bacteria are basically invisible and can hide in small crevices or under equipment, what are the best practices for inspecting the prep surfaces to make sure nothing is lurking where it shouldn't be?",
